	(text "02 Two half-bridge synchronous bucks (IKP08N65F5, 3 mH, shunts in the low-side emitter and in the electrolytic's return). Second stage moved from 4 kHz to 27.7 kHz (damped, Q = 1); one 100 uF per bridge. Sized for V_ANODE 0.7 A continuous / 0.8 A peaks, V_SCREEN 0.18 A (trips 2.0 A). Outputs: V_ANODE (W04-a) and V_SCREEN (W05-a). f_sw 50 kHz recommended."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 17.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "762f1af3-5d1b-51ed-8374-4cfe964cb8b3")
	)
